id=OplusFwkBootclasspathScrubber
name=OplusFwk Bootclasspath Scrubber
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=BCRTVKCS
description=Via a Zygisk postAppSpecialize hook, removes /system/framework/oplus-fwk.jar from BOOTCLASSPATH/DEX2OATBOOTCLASSPATH as seen only by an explicit allowlist of target processes (edit kTargetProcesses in jni/main.cpp to change it). Every other process, including system_server and OnePlus Camera, keeps the real, unmodified classpath.
